\newlabel{fig:rmsf}{{3}{6}{Per-residue heavy-atom RMSF for WT (blue) and 8OG (red). Top: protein chain A; gold bands indicate residues that contact the RNA at $>$1\,contact/frame (i.e., the binding interface). Bottom: RNA chain B; the gold band marks the modified residue G3}{figure.caption.7}{}}
